*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0006
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 938
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0006.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PEN0006C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=ACTIVE S=SUSPENDED C=COLLECTIONS
    05 A-SC               PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 WS-PEN             PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM COLLECTIONS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "A-SC=" A-SC
    DISPLAY "WS-PEN=" WS-PEN
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF LC-12 >= 3
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION
    IF LC-12 >= 4 AND WS-DLT > 45
        MOVE 'S' TO A-SC
        ADD 50 TO WS-PEN
    END-IF.
COLLECTIONS-CHECK.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF WS-DLT > 72
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF WS-DLT > 90
        MOVE 'C' TO A-SC
    END-IF.
